### orders-integrity-report — happy path (admin)
### auth: protect + restrictTo('admin'); story: US1 / FR-004, SC-002c
GET http://localhost:5000/api/orders/integrity-report
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

# expect 200
# {
#   "success": true,
#   "data": {
#     "count": 3,
#     "orderIds": [
#       "65fae0c4d34a8f2e1b9c0001",
#       "65fae0c4d34a8f2e1b9c0042",
#       "65fae0c4d34a8f2e1b9c0117"
#     ]
#   }
# }
#
# Response is read-only — calling this endpoint MUST NOT mutate any Order document.
# Verified by SC-002c (before/after document hash comparison in the test).


### orders-integrity-report — empty result (no legacy records)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/orders/integrity-report
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

# expect 200
# {
#   "success": true,
#   "data": { "count": 0, "orderIds": [] }
# }


### orders-integrity-report — staff role (forbidden)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/orders/integrity-report
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

# expect 403
# { "success": false, "message": "..." }


### orders-integrity-report — customer role (forbidden)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/orders/integrity-report
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

# expect 403


### orders-integrity-report — unauthenticated
GET http://localhost:5000/api/orders/integrity-report

# expect 401


### orders-integrity-report — repeated calls are idempotent
GET http://localhost:5000/api/orders/integrity-report
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
GET http://localhost:5000/api/orders/integrity-report
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

# Second response MUST equal the first. Read-only endpoint.
